info.narration:
[
{No one knows the true appearance of $0.},
{Its form and mere existence are enough to cause discomfort.}
]

[
{Nothing recognizable remains inside the Containment Unit.},
{$0 is creating another child.}
]

[
{#0 cannot withstand the existence of $0 and has panicked.}
]

observe.desc:
[
{The records for this Abnormality have been deleted.}
]

[
{It waits inside its Containment Unit and affects employees who enter.}
]

[
{When an employee cannot withstand its existence, they panic and the Qliphoth Counter decreases.}
]

[
{When the Qliphoth Counter reaches zero, it breaches containment and searches the facility for employees.}
]

[
{It attacks employees. After killing one, it approaches the corpse and creates a new child.}
]
